{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>You brought us</b> — like into a net, and [this is] bad." "<b>Distress</b> — like \"the distress of the wicked is narrow\" (Proverbs 11:8), and so Targum [renders] ומועקה there. Or it is a paʿul, and the adjective word is missing. And the meaning: that it is a thing constricting their foes."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 66, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:52.342882821Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}